Module 3 : Hyperlinks, Images aur Deep Path Routing

Ab hum seekhenge ki web pages ko dusre web pages se kaise jodte hain, aur browser mein files ka path kaise set kiya jata hain. yahan sabse zyaada log galti karte  hain, islye dhyan se samajhna.

1.Hyperlinks( <a> -Anchor Tag )
Anchor tag website par links banane ke liye use hota hain. iska sabse important attribute hai href (Hyperlinks Refrence).

<a href="https://google.com" target="_blank" title="Google par jao">Google Kholein</a>

::href: Isme hum us jagah ka URL ya address dalte hain jahan user ko     bhejna hain.
::target="_blank" : agar yeh nahi likhoge, toh link usi tab mein khul jayegi aur user aapki websites se bahar chala jayega. _blank likhne se link hamesha naye tab (new tab) mein khulegi.
::title : jab user link ke upar apna mouse le jayega (hover karega), toh ek chota sa tooltip box dikhega jisme ye text likha hoga.


2.File Paths: Absolute vs Relative(Raste ka khel)
Jab Aap apni website mein koi Photo lagate ho(<img>) ya koi dusra page jodte ho, toh do tareeqon se rasta diya jata hai.

::Absolute Path: kisi dusri website ko poora address (
    Jaise: [https://example.com/photo.jpg](https://example.com/photo.jpg)
). yeh tab use hota hai jab file internet par kahin aur ho.

:: Relative Path: ye aapke computer ke folder ke hisab se chalta hain.
:: src="logo.png"->> iska matlab file usi same folder mein hai jahan aapki
HTML file hai.
:: src="Images/logo.png"  ->> iska matlab HTML file ke pass ek image naam ka foler hai, aur photo uske ander hai.
:: src="../logo.png" ->>  ../ ka matlab hota hain ek foler bahar (peeche)jaana. Agar aapka code kisi sub-folder ke andar hai aur photo bahar padi hai, toh ../ use hoga.




3.Images Tag(<img>)
Photo dikhane ke liye hum <img> use karte hain. yeh ek Self-closing/Empty tag hai (iska koi </img> nahi hota).

